    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "natural changes? it doesnt feel natural. it feels like a death sentence. they all know what happened, or what they think happened, and now they just look right through me. it's like i'm just a glitch in the room. it's so exhausting pretending i'm still part of this world when i'm clearly not. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i can finally stop feeling this.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
